# Production environment template for the web build (self-hosted setup — see readme.md's
# "Self-hosted — the actual chosen path" section). Copy to .env.production (Vite auto-loads this
# for `vite build`, which `npm run build` already uses by default), or pass VITE_API_URL directly
# on the build command line (as `docker-compose.prod.yml` already does via a build arg) — never
# commit a real .env.production with a value other than this template's placeholder.

# Your machine's real Tailscale HTTPS hostname, from `bash scripts/get-tailscale-cert.sh` — not a
# public domain, since this app is self-hosted on your own private tailnet, not the cloud.
VITE_API_URL=https://<your-machine>.<your-tailnet>.ts.net/api
